 {TEXT("ru.st_anne"),TEXT("ORDER OF ST ANNE"),TEXT("圣安娜勋章"),TEXT("The Order of St Anne recognises military and civil distinction. Swords denote wartime service; Fourth Class is worn on a weapon, while the higher classes have breast, neck and sash forms."),TEXT("圣安娜勋章用于军功与民事功绩。战功加缀佩剑；四级佩在武器上，其余等级依规佩于胸前、颈间或肩带。"),TEXT("Win on either higher difficulty with 36 infantry kills and no friendly fire. Further qualifying victories advance one class at 800, 1600 and 2400 career kills."),TEXT("在较高两档难度下，一役击杀 36 名步兵，无误伤并获胜。累计击杀达 800、1600、2400 人后再立战功，依次晋授。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,0,{0,800,1600},true},
 {TEXT("ru.st_stanislaus"),TEXT("ORDER OF ST STANISLAUS"),TEXT("圣斯坦尼斯拉夫勋章"),TEXT("The Order of St Stanislaus recognises imperial military and civil service. Gold double-headed eagles stand between the red enamel arms; crossed swords mark wartime merit."),TEXT("圣斯坦尼斯拉夫勋章记录帝俄的军政功绩。红珐琅十字间饰以金色双头鹰，战功加缀交叉佩剑。"),TEXT("Clear 3 obstacles, kill 24 infantry and win on either higher difficulty. Further qualifying victories at 6 and 12 career wins advance one class."),TEXT("在较高两档难度下，一役清除 3 处障碍、击杀 24 名步兵并获胜。累计胜利达 6、12 场后再立战功，依次晋授。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,2,{0,6,12},true},
 {TEXT("ru.st_vladimir"),TEXT("ORDER OF ST VLADIMIR"),TEXT("圣弗拉基米尔勋章"),TEXT("The Order of St Vladimir has four classes. A crown and mantle occupy the centre of its black-edged red cross; crossed swords distinguish wartime merit."),TEXT("圣弗拉基米尔勋章有四个等级。黑边红十字中央是王冠与披风，战功加缀交叉佩剑。"),TEXT("Win on either higher difficulty with 48 infantry kills and no friendly fire. Further qualifying victories advance one class at 1200, 2400 and 3600 career kills."),TEXT("在较高两档难度下，一役击杀 48 名步兵，无误伤并获胜。累计击杀达 1200、2400、3600 人后再立战功，依次晋授。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,0,{0,1200,2400},true},
 {TEXT("ru.alexander_nevsky"),TEXT("ORDER OF ST ALEXANDER NEVSKY"),TEXT("圣亚历山大·涅夫斯基勋章"),TEXT("The Order of St Alexander Nevsky recognises high imperial service. Double-headed eagles stand between the red cross arms; swords distinguish wartime merit."),TEXT("圣亚历山大·涅夫斯基勋章属于帝俄的高阶功绩。红十字间饰以双头鹰，战功另加佩剑。"),TEXT("Complete the Russian campaign on either higher difficulty."),TEXT("以较高两档难度之一通关俄国战役。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,4,{1,1,1},true},
 {TEXT("ru.white_eagle"),TEXT("ORDER OF THE WHITE EAGLE"),TEXT("白鹰勋章"),TEXT("The Order of the White Eagle entered the imperial Russian system in 1831. A white eagle and red cross on the black double-headed eagle retain its Polish origins."),TEXT("白鹰勋章于1831年纳入帝俄勋章体系。黑色双头鹰胸前的白鹰红十字，保留了它的波兰渊源。"),TEXT("Complete the Russian campaign on Returned to the Front."),TEXT("以“去而复返”难度通关俄国战役。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,4,{1,1,1},true},
 {TEXT("ru.st_andrew"),TEXT("ORDER OF ST ANDREW"),TEXT("圣安德烈勋章"),TEXT("The Order of St Andrew is the highest imperial Russian distinction. A blue saltire crosses the double-headed eagle; the order has a single regular class."),TEXT("圣安德烈勋章是帝俄的最高荣誉。蓝色斜十字覆于双头鹰之上，只有一个常规等级。"),TEXT("Complete the Russian campaign on Returned to the Front, undefeated."),TEXT("以“去而复返”难度通关俄国战役，全程未败。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,5,{1,1,1},true},
 {TEXT("uk.distinguished_service_cross"),TEXT("DISTINGUISHED SERVICE CROSS"),TEXT("杰出服务十字"),TEXT("The Distinguished Service Cross recognised naval officers’ gallantry. In the Great War, Royal Naval Air Service officers also received it."),TEXT("杰出服务十字表彰海军军官的勇敢。大战期间，皇家海军航空队的军官也曾获授。"),TEXT("Win on Memories of the Abyss or Returned to the Front with 2 armoured vehicles destroyed by fire support. Each further qualifying victory adds a bar."),TEXT("在“深渊回忆”难度或“去而复返”难度下，一役以火力支援击毁 2 辆装甲并获胜。此后每次达成，加授一杠。"),EFRRUNationV81::British,1,{0,0,0},true},
 {TEXT("uk.distinguished_flying_cross"),TEXT("DISTINGUISHED FLYING CROSS"),TEXT("杰出飞行十字"),TEXT("Established in 1918, the Distinguished Flying Cross honoured officers and warrant officers for courage in aerial operations. Repeat awards carried a bar."),TEXT("杰出飞行十字于1918年设立，表彰军官与准尉在空战中的勇敢。再次立功，加授横杠。"),TEXT("From June 1918, after 1000 infantry kills, win on either of the two higher difficulties with 24 infantry kills from aircraft. Further qualifying victories add bars at 2000 and 4000."),TEXT("1918 年 6 月起，累计击杀 1000 名步兵后，在“深渊回忆”难度或“去而复返”难度下，以航空支援击杀 24 名步兵并获胜。累计 2000、4000 人后再达成，各加一杠。"),EFRRUNationV81::British,0,{1000,2000,4000},true},
 {TEXT("uk.distinguished_flying_medal"),TEXT("DISTINGUISHED FLYING MEDAL"),TEXT("杰出飞行奖章"),TEXT("The Distinguished Flying Medal was established in 1918 for airmen below commissioned rank. Its early ribbon carried horizontal violet and white bands."),TEXT("杰出飞行奖章于1918年设立，授予军官以下的航空人员。早期勋带以紫白横纹相间。"),TEXT("From 3 June 1918, win on Memories of the Abyss or Returned to the Front with an armoured vehicle destroyed by aircraft. Each further qualifying victory adds a bar."),TEXT("1918 年 6 月 3 日起，在“深渊回忆”难度或“去而复返”难度下，一役以航空支援击毁 1 辆装甲并获胜。此后每次达成，加授一杠。"),EFRRUNationV81::British,1,{0,0,0},true},
 {TEXT("uk.meritorious_service"),TEXT("MERITORIOUS SERVICE MEDAL"),TEXT("功绩服务奖章"),TEXT("During the Great War, the Meritorious Service Medal also recognised exceptional work away from immediate combat. Its crimson ribbon gained white edges and a central stripe."),TEXT("大战期间，功绩服务奖章也表彰直接交战之外的卓著服务。深红勋带逐渐加上白边与中央白纹。"),TEXT("Win 16 battles, then clear 4 obstacles and win on either of the two higher difficulties."),TEXT("取得 16 场胜利后，在“深渊回忆”难度或“去而复返”难度下，清除 4 处障碍并获胜。"),EFRRUNationV81::British,2,{16,16,16},true},
 {TEXT("de.baden_karl_friedrich"),TEXT("KARL FRIEDRICH MILITARY MERIT MEDAL"),TEXT("卡尔·弗里德里希军事功绩奖章"),TEXT("Baden’s silver military merit medal rewarded enlisted bravery. The gold medal was no longer awarded in the Great War; the crowned griffin remained on the silver face."),TEXT("巴登的银质军事功绩奖章表彰士兵的勇敢。大战期间授予的是银章，章面保留戴冠狮鹫与巴登盾徽。"),TEXT("After morale falls below 30%, kill 48 infantry and win without friendly fire on Memories of the Abyss or Returned to the Front."),TEXT("士气曾跌破 30% 后，在“深渊回忆”或“去而复返”难度下，一役击杀 48 名步兵，无误伤并获胜。"),EFRRUNationV81::German,6,{48,48,48},true},
 {TEXT("de.mecklenburg_merit_cross"),TEXT("MECKLENBURG MILITARY MERIT CROSS"),TEXT("梅克伦堡军事功绩十字"),TEXT("Mecklenburg-Schwerin renewed its Military Merit Cross in 1914. The Second Class hung from a blue, yellow and red ribbon; the First Class was worn as a breast pin."),TEXT("梅克伦堡—什未林于1914年重新颁发军事功绩十字。二级悬于蓝黄红勋带，一级直接别于胸前。"),TEXT("Win on Memories of the Abyss or Returned to the Front. Second Class: clear 3 obstacles and kill 40 infantry in that battle. First Class: repeat with 5 obstacles and 60 infantry."),TEXT("在“深渊回忆”或“去而复返”难度下获胜。二级：一役清除 3 处障碍并击杀 40 名步兵。一级：另立战功，清除 5 处并击杀 60 人。"),EFRRUNationV81::German,6,{3,5,5},true},
 {TEXT("de.oldenburg_friedrich_august"),TEXT("FRIEDRICH AUGUST CROSS"),TEXT("弗里德里希·奥古斯特十字"),TEXT("Oldenburg’s Friedrich August Cross had two classes in the Great War. A black iron cross and laurel wreath formed both; the First Class omitted the suspension ribbon."),TEXT("奥尔登堡的弗里德里希·奥古斯特十字在大战中有两个等级。黑铁十字与月桂枝构成章身，一级不设悬挂勋带。"),TEXT("Win without friendly fire on Memories of the Abyss or Returned to the Front. Second Class: destroy 1 armoured vehicle with fire support. First Class: repeat with 2 in a new victory."),TEXT("在“深渊回忆”或“去而复返”难度下，无误伤并获胜。二级：一役以火力支援击毁 1 辆装甲。一级：另立战功，以支援击毁 2 辆。"),EFRRUNationV81::German,6,{1,2,2},true},
 {TEXT("de.hesse_iron_badge"),TEXT("HESSIAN IRON BADGE"),TEXT("黑森铁质荣誉章"),TEXT("Hesse instituted its Iron Badge in 1917. An oak wreath enclosed the crowned EL monogram and the number 25; it was a breast insignia without a ribbon."),TEXT("黑森于1917年设立铁质荣誉章。橡叶环内是戴冠的EL字样与数字25，直接佩于胸前。"),TEXT("From 14 May 1917, kill 80 infantry in one battle and win without friendly fire on Returned to the Front."),TEXT("1917 年 5 月 14 日起，在“去而复返”难度下，一役击杀 80 名步兵，无误伤并获胜。"),EFRRUNationV81::German,6,{80,80,80},false},
 {TEXT("fr.croix_combattant"),TEXT("COMBATANT’S CROSS"),TEXT("战斗员十字"),TEXT("Established in 1930, the Combatant’s Cross recognised the status of veterans who had fought for France. Seven red stripes crossed its horizon-blue ribbon."),TEXT("战斗员十字于1930年设立，确认曾为法国作战的老兵身份。地平线蓝勋带上排列七道红纹。"),TEXT("Complete the French campaign on either of the two higher difficulties."),TEXT("以“深渊回忆”或“去而复返”难度通关法国战役。"),EFRRUNationV81::French,2,{20,20,20},true},
 {TEXT("fr.volunteer_1914_18"),TEXT("VOLUNTARY COMBATANT’S CROSS · 1914–1918"),TEXT("1914—1918年志愿战斗员十字"),TEXT("The 1935 cross honoured voluntary combatants of 1914–1918. It was a retrospective Great War award, with green, red and yellow on its ribbon."),TEXT("1935年设立的十字表彰1914—1918年的志愿战斗员。绿红黄勋带记载的是大战中的服役。"),TEXT("Complete the French campaign on Returned to the Front, undefeated."),TEXT("以“去而复返”难度通关法国战役，全程未败。"),EFRRUNationV81::French,5,{1,1,1},true},
 {TEXT("fr.evades"),TEXT("ESCAPEES’ MEDAL"),TEXT("脱逃者奖章"),TEXT("Created in 1926, the Escapees’ Medal recognised qualifying escapes from captivity. Its green ribbon carried three orange stripes."),TEXT("脱逃者奖章于1926年设立，表彰符合资格的脱离战俘囚禁者。绿色勋带上列着三道橙纹。"),TEXT("Requires a qualifying escape from enemy captivity."),TEXT("须有符合资格的脱离敌方囚禁记录。"),EFRRUNationV81::French,0,{1600,1600,1600},true},
 {TEXT("fr.reconnaissance"),TEXT("MEDAL OF FRENCH GRATITUDE"),TEXT("法国感恩奖章"),TEXT("Created in 1917, the Medal of French Gratitude honoured voluntary aid to the wounded, disabled and refugees. Bronze, silver and silver-gilt were its three classes."),TEXT("法国感恩奖章于1917年设立，表彰对伤员、残疾者与难民的自愿援助。铜、银与镀金银章是三个真实等级。"),TEXT("Bronze: after 12 victories, clear 4 obstacles and win on either of the two higher difficulties. Further qualifying victories grant Silver at 24 wins and Vermeil at 40."),TEXT("铜章：取得 12 场胜利后，在“深渊回忆”难度或“去而复返”难度下，清除 4 处障碍并获胜。累计 24、40 场后再达成，依次晋授银章与镀金银章。"),EFRRUNationV81::French,2,{12,24,40},true},
 {TEXT("ru.st_george_weapon"),TEXT("ST GEORGE WEAPON"),TEXT("圣乔治武器"),TEXT("The St George Weapon was an officer’s award for bravery. A small white St George cross and the words “For Bravery” marked its gold-mounted hilt."),TEXT("圣乔治武器授予勇敢的军官。镀金剑柄上的小白十字与“为了勇敢”铭文，标明这份荣誉。"),TEXT("After 40 armour kills, complete Russia on Returned to the Front, undefeated."),TEXT("累计击毁 40 辆装甲后，以“去而复返”难度通关俄国战役，全程未败。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,1,{40,40,40},false},
 {TEXT("ru.for_zeal"),TEXT("MEDAL FOR ZEAL"),TEXT("勤勉奖章"),TEXT("Imperial Russia’s Medal For Zeal rewarded meritorious service. Silver and gold breast medals existed alongside separate neck-worn forms."),TEXT("帝俄的勤勉奖章表彰尽职服务。银质与金质胸章之外，另有独立的颈佩式样。"),TEXT("Silver: after 16 victories, clear 4 obstacles and win on either of the two higher difficulties. Gold: repeat after 32 victories."),TEXT("银章：取得 16 场胜利后，在“深渊回忆”难度或“去而复返”难度下，清除 4 处障碍并获胜。累计 32 场后再达成，晋授金章。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,2,{16,32,32},true},
 {TEXT("ru.red_cross_badge"),TEXT("RUSSIAN RED CROSS BADGE"),TEXT("俄国红十字荣誉章"),TEXT("The men’s Red Cross badge was established in 1899 for distinguished humanitarian service. Great War medical workers also received this breast insignia."),TEXT("男式红十字荣誉章于1899年设立，表彰卓著的人道救护服务。大战中的医疗人员也曾获授。"),TEXT("After 20 victories, win on either of the two higher difficulties with at least 24 infantry returning and 75% of the entered infantry alive."),TEXT("取得 20 场胜利后，在“深渊回忆”难度或“去而复返”难度下获胜，至少 24 名步兵归队，入场步兵至少 75% 生还。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,2,{20,20,20},false},
 {TEXT("ru.mobilisation_1914"),TEXT("GENERAL MOBILISATION MEDAL · 1914"),TEXT("1914年总动员奖章"),TEXT("Instituted in 1915, this medal recognised distinguished work in the mobilisation of 1914. The bronze medal hung from the dark-blue ribbon of the White Eagle."),TEXT("1915年设立的总动员奖章，记录1914年动员中的卓著工作。铜章悬于白鹰勋章的深蓝勋带。"),TEXT("Win 24 Russian battles on either of the two higher difficulties."),TEXT("以“深渊回忆”或“去而复返”难度，取得 24 场俄军胜利。"),EFRRUNationV81::Russian,2,{24,24,24},true},
};
